        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>How to Organize - 自我...</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #222;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .phone {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    border: 1px solid #eee;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 14px 18px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .header-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .header-left .sep {\n    color: #bbb;\n    margin: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .header-left .dim {\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 18px;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  main {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 18px 20px 20px 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  ul.level1 {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  ul.level1 > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  ul.level1 > li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  ul.level2 {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding-left: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  ul.level2 > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  ul.level2 > li::before {\n    content: \"○\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  h1.section {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 22px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  h2.sub {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #43a047;\n    margin: 20px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #2e7d32;\n  }\n  footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .plus-box {\n    border: 2px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <span>&#9776;</span>\n      <span>&#128394; 自我...</span>\n      <span class=\"sep\">/</span>\n      <span class=\"dim\">How to Org...</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <span>&#8593;</span>\n      <span>&#128172;</span>\n      <span>&#8943;</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <ul class=\"level2\">\n      <li>比如你记录了一个 &#128161; 想法，这个想法未来会运用到 撰写书籍里面。你就把这个想法放到撰写书籍&#128218;的文件夹里。当你下次需要撰写书籍的时候，这些想法就可以帮助到你。</li>\n      <li>通过未来的可行性整理你的内容，而不是客观的记录这个事件。</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h1 class=\"section\">D: Distill &nbsp;提炼</h1>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sub\">Progressive Summarization &nbsp;渐进式总结</h2>\n    <ul class=\"level1\">\n      <li>它依赖于在一段时间内分多个阶段对笔记进行总结。<strong>你只保存你所读的东西中最好的摘录，然后对这些摘录进行总结，再对该总结进行总结</strong>，在每个阶段提炼出内容的精髓。这些\"层\"就像一张数字地图，可以放大或缩小到你需要的任何细节水平。</li>\n      <li>渐进式总结使你可以为不同的目的以不同的方式阅读笔记：如果你想收集每一个细节，就深入阅读，如果你只需要主要的收获，就在高层次上阅读。这使你能够在几秒钟内审视笔记的内容，以决定它对手头的任务是否有用。</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sub\">Organize opportunistically &nbsp;择机整理，一次一点</h2>\n    <ul class=\"level1\">\n      <li>花费大量的时间来创建高度结构化、完美主义的笔记是很诱人的。问题是，你往往不知道哪些资料最终会有价值，直到很久以后。与其在前期投入大量精力，<strong>不如适时地组织你的笔记</strong>，随着时间的推移一点点地整理。</li>\n    </ul>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <span>&#128269;</span>\n    <span>&#128276;</span>\n    <span class=\"plus-box\">&#43;</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
